      "quote": "Number: 86 Name: Sequence Number\nCharacter Type: N Maximum Length: 6 bytes\nRepresentation: Fixed length of six digits\nPurpose: Note: Identifies a transaction for the life of the transaction.\nSequence Number must persist in all the subsequent transactions that are associated with the initial authorization request.",
